# Implementation plan

The checklist in `README.md` is frozen. Do not add, remove, rename, or reorder items unless the user explicitly agrees in that conversation.

When a plan item is fully done, mark it `- [x]`. Do not delete it. If work is only partial, leave it unchecked and note progress in the reply — do not invent new README bullets.

## Next section

When the user wants to plan the next section (including “Let’s plan on the next section in the implementation plan”):

1. Find the first `###` section under Implementation plan that still has unchecked items.
2. Plan **only that section** (use Plan mode if available).
3. Do not start coding until they confirm.
4. Do not pull in later sections or Backlog.

Backlog stays untouched until the user agrees to promote an item into the active plan.
